# Testing

## Vitest

- `composeSrcDoc`: CSS fidelity, force attribute, no over-escaping
- `buildPrompt`: no “playground”, fence escalation, RM clause, snapshot SPX-001
- Prefer `demo.style.txt?raw` in specimen imports (see `30_specimens`)

## Playwright (`e2e/`)

Smoke floor: catalogue plate count, clipboard copy non-empty, detail five tabs, playground hash restore.

## CLI

- `spec:check` — non-empty html/css/spec/contract, unique id/ref, css twin sync, required facets + inspiration directory checks, no tag/facet/inspiration collisions, tech↔js consistency
- `spec:new <slug>` — scaffold folder matching section 3 of the design spec

## Performance

Lighthouse mobile `/` with sheet paused (reduced motion) ≥ **90**. Fix frame mounting before bundle size.

Specimen HTML/CSS/JS/spec/contract live in per-folder `payload.ts` chunks loaded via explicit `loadPayload` (never `import.meta.glob`). Routes are `React.lazy`-split so Shell paints before specimen meta (entry `modulePreload` skips Catalogue/harness/payloads). PreviewFrame sizes with CSS container queries (no post-paint JS scale). Fonts load after first paint. Use `npm run analyze` after build to inspect chunk sizes.
